[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16980.55, "timestamp": "04:43:00", "text": "房间里有人在说话，好像在说些什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16982.628, "timestamp": "04:43:02", "text": "到那时我肯定会惊慌失措。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16986.788, "timestamp": "04:43:06", "text": "就像哑巴一样。静音功能在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16992.628, "timestamp": "04:43:12", "text": "这就是为什么我努力让自己变得像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16994.628, "timestamp": "04:43:14", "text": "麦克风带有静音触摸功能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16997.43, "timestamp": "04:43:17", "text": "东西。容易"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17000.07, "timestamp": "04:43:20", "text": "而不是像在 OBS 或 Windows 系统中那样操作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17003.19, "timestamp": "04:43:23", "text": "静音键在哪儿？我慌了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17006.948, "timestamp": "04:43:26", "text": "因为我当时有了那种势头，就像我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17009.03, "timestamp": "04:43:29", "text": "忙碌不堪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17012.788, "timestamp": "04:43:32", "text": "我目前有一个耳机，就像我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17014.55, "timestamp": "04:43:34", "text": "我正在攒钱买麦克风，而且我喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17017.27, "timestamp": "04:43:37", "text": "我大概会选一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17019.91, "timestamp": "04:43:39", "text": "但是，目前我们有耳机。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17021.75, "timestamp": "04:43:41", "text": "我们正在着手处理这个问题。我不介意"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17023.51, "timestamp": "04:43:43", "text": "耳机麦克风也很好用，但就是这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17025.35, "timestamp": "04:43:45", "text": "就像这个特别的一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17028.23, "timestamp": "04:43:48", "text": "对我来说很沉重。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17030.47, "timestamp": "04:43:50", "text": "所以当工作时间很长的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17034.31, "timestamp": "04:43:54", "text": "流媒体播放时，它有点像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17037.75, "timestamp": "04:43:57", "text": "我头很重，感觉就像……"}]